      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOUISE LUCK (10) missed the placings two runs back then did a great job to score by a nose despite breaking in the run over 2030m at this track a week ago. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run but might need things to go her way at some stage. Big chance again in a similar assignment. GOOD LOOKING JUJON (8) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 2.25 metres from the winner in second over 1780m at Redcliffe. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position. Big chance based on those recent efforts. BRING YOUR BEST (1) found form and finished third two runs ago then came back to earth when he broke following a check and finished a long last over 1609m at Tamworth. Has the benefit of a good draw this time. Live chance in a similar assignment. THREETWONINE (3) has been just fair of late, including a fourth last start at Menangle over 1609m. In the mix on best form",
